{
  "title": "Swing-duration heavy tails do not establish incremental Parkinson prediction: an exploratory cross-collection analysis",
  "abstract": "Swing-duration excess kurtosis did not establish added Parkinson/control prediction beyond conventional gait summaries in exploratory cross-collection testing: delta logloss -0.002430, joint bootstrap95%CI [-0.035554,0.059688]. Poor split-window stability and threshold sensitivity argue against a robust biomarker claim.",
